# Hand-authored Plastic Ox trainer parties.
#
# plastic_ox/tools/apply_trainer_teams_v2.py never regenerates a trainer listed
# here, and test_trainer_teams_v2.py fails unless src/data/trainers.party holds
# exactly the same block. Edit the block here AND in trainers.party (or copy it
# across); the trainer's ROSTERS entry still sets its checkpoint, so species,
# tier, level-cap and move-legality checks keep applying.
#
# Moved here 2026-11-25: these teams had been tuned by hand in trainers.party
# and no longer matched what the generator would write.

